---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+13015550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(301) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Cracked & Splintered Deck Boards Gaithersburg" description="Cracks and splinters worsen with weather and create injury risks. Timely replacement or refinishing stops the progression.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Cracked or Splintered Wood</h1>
      <p>Cracks and splinters worsen with weather and create injury risks. Timely replacement or refinishing stops the progression.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.25rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Get Help — {phoneDisplay}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Surface Damage That Gets Worse</h2>
        <p>Checking and cracking are common in pressure-treated and hardwood decks. When cracks become deep or produce splinters, board replacement or careful sanding and refinishing is the practical solution.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule an Inspection</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
